Z||000006||Uaana||05-18-2000||06:27 PM||||That can't be that hard.<BR>Just make a quick template of the size you want, cut out a piece of lightweight fiberboard, then get a piece of matching material, bond 3 sides to the underside, stuff with poly fill, bond fourth side, and apply either dbl sided tape or velcro.<BR>Hmm now I can go into busisness and retire ||||reg||1
